Subject: [PATCH 4/5] build: Dockerfile: Support containers from packaged
 source

Stop copying Git and app trees into frontend image layers so packaged source
uses the same Dockerfile without invalidating the dependency cache.

Pass source revisions through local and GitHub Actions image entry points, and
bind app metadata read-only only while the frontend build runs.
